    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Ты жарить не умеешь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot fry.' Tasting Fedya's pan-fried meat, Senya mocks him for not knowing how to fry properly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Мясо жёсткое, как подошва.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The meat is tough as a shoe sole.' Senya complains that the cut came out as tough as the sole of a boot.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Мы на флоте сапоги ели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the navy we ate boots.' Never one to back down, Fedya brags that when he served in the navy, they could cook and eat actual boots.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "И ремни тоже ели.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And we ate belts too.' Pushing the tall tale further, he claims they ate leather belts too.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Ты врёшь про сапоги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are lying about the boots.' Senya laughs in his face and says he is lying about eating boots.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Не веришь мне?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You don't believe me?' Fedya challenges Senya for doubting his navy stories.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Давай поспорим на пять штук.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's bet five grand.' To settle it, Fedya offers to bet five thousand rubles right now.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Съешь мой ремень за пять штук?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You'll eat my belt for five grand?' Senya asks if Fedya will really eat Senya's own leather belt for five grand.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ну, съем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I'll eat it.' Realizing what he just walked into, Fedya bluffs and says sure, he will eat it. Then Senya replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Луи, разбей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Louis, break it.' Calling the bet immediately, Senya asks Louis to break their handshake to seal the wager.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay.' Louis steps in and slices their hands apart to make the kitchen bet official.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Держи ремень.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is the belt.' Grinning, Senya unbuckles his leather belt and hands it straight to Fedya. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
